<title>USA: Prentiss Properties higher after IPO.</title>
<headline>Prentiss Properties higher after IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prentiss Properties Trust shares rose about seven percent after the market debut of the real estate investment trust, which owns interests in 87 office and industrial properties.</p>
<p>The shares rose 1-3/8 to 21-3/8 in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The company offered 16 million shares, up from its original filing for 14.3 million shares, for $20 each. Lehman was the lead underwriter of the offering.</p>
</text>
